{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18751","headline":"畲田行 · 刘禹锡","name":"畲田行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处好畲田，团团缦山腹。\n鑚龟得雨卦，上山烧卧木。\n惊麏走且顾，羣雉声咿喔。\n红焰远成霞，轻煤飞入郭。\n风引上高岑，猎猎度青林。\n青林望靡靡，赤光低复起。\n照潭出老蛟，爆竹惊山鬼。\n夜色不见山，孤明星汉间。\n如星复如月，俱逐晓风灭。\n本从敲石光，遂至烘天热。\n下种暖灰中，乘阳拆牙孽。\n苍苍一雨後，苕頴如云发。\n巴人拱手吟，耕耨不关心。\n由来得地势，径寸有余金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18751.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18751","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}